  Why This Matters
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Most AI coding tools start from scratch every time. Meeseeks Hive agents build collective knowledge—they remember what worked, query semantically similar tasks, and evolve strategies based on actual performance data.&lt;/p&gt;

